            "review_title": "Review at BBQ Saigon Night - BÀ SÁU BÙI VIỆN",
            "review_text": "julian\nAustralia8 contributions\n0\nBBQ Seafood on Bui Vien Street\nFeb 2023 • Couples\nIf you're looking for great BBQ seafood in Saigon, then BBQ Saigon Night is the place to go. Located on the bustling walking street Bui Vien, this restaurant offers a variety of delicious seafood dishes at a reasonable price. The atmosphere is lively and the staff is very friendly and accommodating. I like the Bui Vien Street, where you can party like a rockstar, eat like a king, and bargain like a boss, whether you want to drink cheap beer, try exotic food, or shop for souvenirs, this street has it all. Just watch out for the traffic and the scams!\nRead more\nWritten February 23, 2023",
