            "review_title": "Review at BBQ Saigon Night - BÀ SÁU BÙI VIỆN",
            "review_text": "Allin\nAuckland Central, New Zealand5 contributions\n0\nDelicious BBQ Seafood on Bui Vien street\nFeb 2023 • Couples\nIf you are looking for a delicious seafood feast in Ho Chi Minh City, look no further than BBQ Saigon night. Located on the bustling Bui Vien Street, this restaurant offers fresh seafood grilled to perfection. You can choose from a variety of dishes such as shrimp, squid, fish, and clams, all at a reasonable price. Enjoy your meal with a cold beer and the lively atmosphere of the street. BBQ Saigon night is a must-try for seafood lovers!\nRead more\nWritten February 18, 2023",
